{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026jiZl02g4G11793004365.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>長腿女神戴祖儀（Joey）憑藉甜美外表與鬼馬活潑的性格，一直深受觀眾與網民喜愛。早前 Joey 為拍攝無綫新劇《驅魔速遞》，特別染了一頭亮眼的粉紅色短髮，新造型令人眼前一亮！</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"a26cdff9-5016-4eb8-9ac6-4496b258a62b.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026jDyhLCOGdi1793004367.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>向來喜愛 ACG（動漫電玩）文化的她，近日再於社交平台大派震撼福利，上載了一輯造型極具突破性的 Cosplay 寫真，驚喜化身超人氣日本動漫《膽大黨》（Dandadan）中的熱門角色「白鳥愛羅」，酷帥又可愛的造型隨即掀起全網熱烈討論。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"527ac02c-3ed8-4669-8834-e6fbfefee4ee.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026H6xJe82qtM1793004365.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>從 Joey 分享的照片可見，她身穿水手服風格的深藍色西裝外套，搭配紫色百褶短裙，胸前更綴有搶眼的紅色大蝴蝶結，青春少女感爆燈！為了完美還原角色的戰鬥形態，Joey 還特別戴上半遮面面具，擺出帥氣十足又帶點酷勁的戰鬥姿勢，完美展現出與平日截然不同的多變魅力與氣場。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"5577cb31-51c9-4b6c-8796-bdb684ecf1b6.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026Faikc4rmu71793004367.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:00:45.456609+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:58:07.257397+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:58:09.505235+00:00","content_hash":"cdc9df0d5a07033c60395216ba2a37476fd496c62334e093f43c5897b8f956f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:00:45.456609+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}